{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive beak on to victory!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seagull Kart Racing is a frenetic and fun racing game in witch you're not bound like a mear mortal by gravity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wings and your wit to be the first seagull to cross the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just arrived in a new city and a parent from the future tells you that you're the only seagull capable of defeating the racing master, an alien entity that races across the universe destroying civilizations that aren't up to it . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins your training in time and space to become the fastest seagull of all time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You can fly! Forget about gravity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use 8 amazing power ups to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Online multiplayer race mode (up to 8 players) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controller and keyboard support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Single player story mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Single player timed races</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize your seagull</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468210?t=1753850498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753850498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753850498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753850498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Onlin